==German==

===Etymology===
Originally meaning "straight", from ''Richtschnur'', a line used to build or draw straight, thus related to {{m|de|richten||to adjust}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʀɪçtɪç/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-richtig.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-richtig.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

